he composition follows a rule of thirds, with the subject positioned slightly off-center to create visual interest and balance. The quality tags include: photorealistic digital painting, high-resolution (4K), meticulous attention to detail and texture, warm lighting, serene atmosphere, vibrant colors, realistic water and skin textures.
